# Production is deployed only from the linked GitHub repository. This file is
# relevant to Vercel CLI source uploads (Git deployments use the committed tree).
# An ordinary CLI source deploy receives only enough code to run the prebuild
# attestation and fail. This file does not govern `vercel deploy --prebuilt`;
# project permissions and post-deploy source readback remain mandatory. Preview
# deployments should also be created by pushing a Git branch.
/*
!package.json
!vercel.json
!scripts
scripts/*
!scripts/verify-production-source.mjs
